  "synopsis": "Tuke is a spirit guardian exiled to the mortal realm. For centuries, he's protected humanity with eight other spirit guardians. But the River God's Son, who was sealed away by them, breaks free and takes control of seven spirit guardians' souls, plotting to transform the world into a purgatory. To save his friends and defeat the River God's Son, Tuke ventures all the way to the Son's stronghold, where an epic battle ensues...\n\n(Source: Youku)",
